messages.content:
{
  "summary": "Let’s fix the obvious blockers first: your phone’s Data Roaming is OFF, you’re stuck on 2G with poor signal, and a VPN is connected. We’ll enable device-side roaming, disconnect VPN, and force the phone to prefer 4G/5G, then retest.",
  "why_these_steps": [
    "Data Roaming OFF prevents mobile data while abroad even if your line is roaming-enabled on our side.",
    "A connected VPN can block or severely slow data, especially on weak/roaming links.",
    "2G is too slow for your Excellent requirement; switching to 4G/5G preferred lets the device attach to faster networks."
  ],
  "immediate_actions_for_you": [
    {
      "action": "Enable Data Roaming",
      "how": "Use toggle_roaming to turn Data Roaming ON."
    },
    {
      "action": "Disconnect VPN",
      "how": "Use disconnect_vpn to fully disconnect any active VPN."
    },
    {
      "action": "Prefer faster networks",
      "how": "Use set_network_mode_preference with mode set to \"4g_5g_preferred\"."
    },
    {
      "action": "Refresh the data session (optional but helpful)",
      "how": "Use toggle_data to turn Mobile Data OFF, wait 10 seconds, then turn it back ON."
    }
  ],
  "then_recheck": [
    "Run check_status_bar and check_network_status again and share the outputs (signal strength, network type, Data Roaming ON, VPN status).",
    "Run run_speed_test and share the new result. We’re aiming for Excellent."
  ],
  "next_if_not_excellent": [
    "If speeds are still below Excellent, we’ll continue with the Step 2 diagnostics you mentioned: check_network_mode_preference (to confirm it stuck), check_data_restriction_status (turn OFF Data Saver if ON), check_vpn_status (ensure VPN stayed disconnected), and check_apn_settings (if APN looks wrong, we’ll reset_apn_settings and then reboot_device)."
  ],
  "note_on_refuel": "You still have 6.3 GB remaining in your plan this cycle. Refueling adds quota but does not increase speed. If you later need more data, I can add up to 2.0 GB at $2/GB on request.",
