  "greeting": "Hi John — thanks for reaching out. I’ve pulled up your account for 555-123-2002 and I can help you get mobile data working properly while you’re in France.",
  "what_i_checked_on_our_side": {
    "line": {
      "phone_number": "555-123-2002",
      "status": "Active",
      "roaming_enabled_on_account": true,
      "plan_id": "P1002",
      "data_usage_this_cycle_gb": 8.7,
      "data_limit_gb": 15.0,
      "data_refueled_gb": 0.0,
      "billing_cycle_ends": "2025-02-28"
    },
    "plan": {
      "name": "Premium Plan",
      "data_refuel_price_per_gb_usd": 2.0,
      "max_refuel_gb": 2
    }
  },
  "key_point_about_speed_and_refueling": "Right now you’ve used 8.7 GB out of 15 GB, so you have not hit your data cap. Refueling only increases your data allowance; it does not increase speed. Because you haven’t reached the limit, refueling 2.0 GB will not improve speed. Let’s optimize your device settings first for the best possible roaming performance.",
  "plan_to_fix_this": {
    "reasoning": "When roaming, speed issues are usually caused by device settings (data roaming, network mode, data saver, VPN) or local network conditions. Your line is already enabled for roaming on our side, so we’ll verify and optimize your phone’s settings to allow the fastest available network (4G/5G) and remove any speed limiters.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "action": "check_status_bar",
        "what_to_do": "Look at the top status bar. Confirm: Airplane Mode is OFF; you see at least some signal bars; and ideally a network indicator like 4G/LTE/5G. Also confirm Mobile Data icon is present/enabled.",
        "if_issue_found": "If you see an airplane icon, please turn Airplane Mode OFF (toggle_airplane_mode)."
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "action": "check_network_status",
        "what_to_do": "Verify that Mobile Data is ON and Data Roaming is ON on your phone.",
        "if_issue_found": "If Mobile Data is OFF, turn it ON (toggle_data). If Data Roaming is OFF, turn it ON (toggle_roaming)."
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "action": "check_network_mode_preference",
        "what_to_do": "Check your preferred network mode.",
        "expected": "Set it to 4g_5g_preferred to allow the fastest available network.",
        "if_issue_found": "If it’s set to 2G or 3G, change it to 4g_5g_preferred (set_network_mode_preference)."
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "action": "check_vpn_status",
        "what_to_do": "See if a VPN is connected.",
        "if_issue_found": "If a VPN is connected, disconnect it (disconnect_vpn) because VPNs can slow roaming speeds significantly."
      },
      {
        "step": 5,
        "action": "check_data_restriction_status",
        "what_to_do": "Check whether Data Saver is ON.",
        "if_issue_found": "If Data Saver is ON, turn it OFF (toggle_data_saver_mode) to avoid throttling/background restrictions."
      },
      {
        "step": 6,
        "action": "check_apn_settings",
        "what_to_do": "Verify APN is set correctly (especially the MMSC/APN fields).",
        "if_issue_found": "If APN looks incorrect or blank, reset to default (reset_apn_settings) and then fully reboot your phone (reboot_device) for changes to apply."
      },
      {
        "step": 7,
        "action": "run_speed_test",
        "what_to_do": "Run a speed test over mobile data and share the result category with me: no connection, very poor, poor, fair, good, or excellent.",
        "goal": "We’re targeting excellent."
      },
      {
        "step": 8,
        "action": "reseat_sim_card_and_reboot_if_needed",
        "what_to_do": "If speeds are still below excellent after the steps above, reseat the SIM (reseat_sim_card) and then reboot (reboot_device).",
        "why": "This refreshes the radio registration with the roaming network."
      }
    ],
    "note": "If after these optimizations you still don’t see excellent speeds, the limitation may be the local roaming network capacity in your current area. I’ll still help you try alternatives (e.g., forcing 4G-only if 5G is spotty, or the reverse) to see which performs better."
  },
  "refuel_option": {
    "can_add_up_to_gb": 2,
    "price_per_gb_usd": 2.0,
    "will_it_increase_speed": "No, it only increases your remaining data allowance. Since you’re at 8.7/15 GB, refueling won’t address speed.",
    "if_you_still_want_it": "Tell me how many GB (up to 2.0) you’d like to add. For example, 2.0 GB would cost $4.00."
  },
  "what_i_need_from_you": [
    "Confirm you’re ready to go through the steps. Please perform steps 1–6 in order and tell me what you find (especially whether Data Roaming is ON, the network mode is 4g_5g_preferred, Data Saver is OFF, and whether a VPN was connected).",
    "After step 6, run the speed test (step 7) and share the result category.",
    "Optional: Your city/area in France (helps me reason about roaming partners, though I can’t change local network conditions).",
    "Let me know if you still want to refuel data (how many GB)."
  ]
}

