    "Identified you by your phone number 555-123-2002 (customer ID C1001).",
    "Confirmed your line L1002 is Active and belongs to plan P1002.",
    "Saw international roaming was OFF for your line and enabled it just now at no cost so you can use data in France.",
    "Checked usage: you’ve used 8.7 GB of your 15 GB plan this cycle, so you still have about 6.3 GB left. A data refill is not needed at this time."
  ],
  "why_this_matters": "MMS requires working cellular data. When traveling, you need both roaming enabled on your account (I turned that on) and data roaming enabled in your phone’s settings. We’ll also verify a few phone settings (Wi‑Fi Calling, network mode, APN/MMSC) that commonly block MMS.",
  "next_steps_for_you": [
    {
      "step": "1",
      "action": "Verify mobile data is ON and Data Roaming is ON in your phone settings.",
      "how": "Run check_network_status. If it shows mobile data disabled, use toggle_data to turn it ON. If it shows roaming disabled, use toggle_roaming to turn it ON.",
      "reason": "Your account roaming is now enabled, but your phone must also allow data and roaming."
    },
    {
      "step": "2",
      "action": "Temporarily turn OFF Wi‑Fi Calling.",
      "how": "Run check_wifi_calling_status. If it’s ON, use toggle_wifi_calling to turn it OFF.",
      "reason": "Some configurations interfere with MMS while roaming."
    },
    {
      "step": "3",
      "action": "Confirm you’re not locked to 2G/3G.",
      "how": "Run check_network_mode_preference. If it’s 2G or 3G, use set_network_mode_preference with \"4g_5g_preferred\".",
      "reason": "MMS needs at least 3G; 4G/5G is recommended."
    },
    {
      "step": "4",
      "action": "Quick connectivity check.",
      "how": "Run run_speed_test.",
      "reason": "Confirms you have active data while roaming. If it reports no connection, we’ll know to focus on device data settings first."
    },
