        "Android: Settings > Mobile Network (or Connections) > Preferred network type.",
        "It should include 4G/5G (best: 4g_5g_preferred)."
      ],
      "what_to_share": "Tell me what mode it’s set to.",
      "fix_if_needed": {
        "tool": "set_network_mode_preference",
        "target_mode": "4g_5g_preferred",
