        "Remove the SIM tray, take the SIM out, reinsert it carefully, and put the tray back.",
        "Power on and wait 1–2 minutes to see if signal bars appear."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "request": "Please run Steps 1–3 and share the exact results (SIM status, network status details, and preferred network mode). If SIM is Missing, go ahead with Step 5 to reseat the SIM and tell me what changes. I’ll use your results to guide the next fix immediately."
}

