        "If status bar shows 4G/LTE/5G with signal bars, send a test MMS and report the result.",
        "If status bar still shows No Signal, please reboot the phone next, then re-check status bar and try the MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "if": "SIM shows Locked",
      "then": [
        "Do not attempt random PIN/PUK entries.",
        "Tell me and I will transfer you to a human agent to assist with SIM security."
